  "document": "Henry Raspe, Landgrave of Thuringia\nHenry Raspe (German: \"Heinrich Raspe\" ) (1204 – 16 February 1247) succeeded his nephew Hermann II as Landgrave of Thuringia in central Germany in 1241; he later was elected anti-king in 1246–1247 in opposition to Conrad IV of Germany."
